HOW TO USE:
1. Press "Select file"
2. Choose a text file with data from your computer
3. Press "Export stats to .txt"
4. Select a location to save the stats file and choose a name

WHAT TO EXPECT:
The program will read the selected text file and calculate the following:
1. Number of values in the file
2. Mean value of data points
3. Standard deviation
4. Root mean square
Exporting the stats will make a new text file with this data in it.

